Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 15:05:11 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 我们来聊一聊如何提高口才
Segment #2   [00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,660] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 语言是一门非常伟大的艺术
Segment #3   [00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,960] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 11 | Text: 口才好就意味着你的青山高
Segment #4   [00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:09,960] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 15 | Text: 会说话可以帮你解决到很多不必要的问题
Segment #5   [00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,500] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 如果你平时觉得自己的表达力不好
Segment #6   [00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,860] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者说思维逻辑很差
Segment #7   [00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:16,580] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 11 | Text: 表达不清楚自己最真实的想法
Segment #8   [00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,580] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 缺乏条理没有内容
Segment #9   [00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:21,260] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 13 | Text: 请你一定要看完这期史上最强干货
Segment #10  [00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,500] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 13 | Text: 很多人说看书可以提高一个人的口才
Segment #11  [00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,420] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 3  | Text: 其实并不是
Segment #12  [00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:28,820] | Elapsed:  16.00s | Words: 15 | Text: 书只能让你明白一些书中所表达的道理
Segment #13  [00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:31,300] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 14 | Text: 而并非是有我们生活中所实现的结果
Segment #14  [00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,260] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 9  | Text: 你通过几本看几本书
Segment #15  [00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,260] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 你口才就提升了
Segment #16  [00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,060] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 这怎么可能呢
Segment #17  [00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,240] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 11 | Text: 就好比你看了很多年的英文电影
Segment #18  [00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,640] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 9  | Text: 你的英语能力提升了吗
Segment #19  [00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 11 | Text: 你天天从家看德文社相声
Segment #20  [00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,780] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 你会说相声吗
Segment #21  [00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:42,760] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 你变得幽默了吗
Segment #22  [00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,500] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 3  | Text: 好像并没有
Segment #23  [00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,820] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们仔细思考一下
Segment #24  [00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,280] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 其实我们会发现
Segment #25  [00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,720] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们的口才不好
Segment #26  [00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:49,980] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 就两个原因
Segment #27  [00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:52,480] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 10 | Text: 第一个你的机关基本功不扎实
Segment #28  [00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:55,300] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 15 | Text: 就好比那个武侠电影里的小爬菜一样
Segment #29  [00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,560] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 老天你跑两步路
Segment #30  [00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,060] | Elapsed:  32.91s | Words: 9  | Text: 你喘气你都喘不开了
Segment #31  [00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,620] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 你直接去练翔哥龙十八掌
Segment #32  [00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:00,440] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 你能练练吗
Segment #33  [00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,280] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 就好比你去踢足球
Segment #34  [00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,660] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 你还都没足球跑得快
Segment #35  [00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:04,540] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 你怎么学站位
Segment #36  [00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:05,820] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 怎么射门怎么学防守
Segment #37  [00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,320] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 其实说白了
Segment #38  [00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,360] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 它就像盖房子是一个道理
Segment #39  [00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,560] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 地基你都打不稳
Segment #40  [00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,160] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 上层建筑你更盖不起来
Segment #41  [00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:14,240] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 而且这个基本功不扎实
Segment #42  [00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:16,980] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 主要就是脑子里没东西
Segment #43  [00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,640] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 肚子里没磨迹
Segment #44  [00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:20,800] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 咱还说了个没东西
Segment #45  [00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,360] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 昨天有个朋友在直播间
Segment #46  [00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,900] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 跟我聊天联卖
Segment #47  [00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:24,480] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 他问我说
Segment #48  [00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,840] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 我性格又内向啊
Segment #49  [00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,320] | Elapsed:  51.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 嘴巴也不知道该说什么
Segment #50  [00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,580] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后我就问他
Segment #51  [00:01:28,580 --> 00:01:29,680] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 我说你手背不卖
Segment #52  [00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,120] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 很简单的一个道理
Segment #53  [00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,300] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 有一些东西
Segment #54  [00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:34,080] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 8  | Text: 你如果说写都写不出来
Segment #55  [00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,600] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 你怎么能说出来呢
Segment #56  [00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:37,600] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 8  | Text: 你如果说从小就是这种
Segment #57  [00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:38,520] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 3  | Text: 写作文
Segment #58  [00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,980] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 写文案很费劲的人
Segment #59  [00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:41,700] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 而且写得很糟糕的人
Segment #60  [00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:42,660] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 5  | Text: 那你的表达力
Segment #61  [00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:44,400] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 11 | Text: 我感觉应该也好到哪里去
Segment #62  [00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,280] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 这里边很大的一部分原因
Segment #63  [00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,580] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是你的脑子里没有东西
Segment #64  [00:01:48,580 --> 00:01:49,760] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 6  | Text: 口才好是口才
Segment #65  [00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,220] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个东西是思维逻辑能力
Segment #66  [00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:52,380] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 7  | Text: 加语言表达能力
Segment #67  [00:01:52,380 --> 00:01:53,040] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 4  | Text: 缺一不可
Segment #68  [00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:54,500] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 3  | Text: 我知道有很多
Segment #69  [00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,940] | Elapsed:  71.37s | Words: 11 | Text: 想通过看书提高自己口才的人
Segment #70  [00:01:56,940 --> 00:01:58,820] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 9  | Text: 都会把问题想得很简单
Segment #71  [00:01:58,820 --> 00:02:00,280] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 那就是我通过
Segment #72  [00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:02,080] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 不怎么努力的方式
Segment #73  [00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,660] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 9  | Text: 也能提高自己的表达力
Segment #74  [00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:04,840] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 想法很美好
Segment #75  [00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,320] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是现实却很残酷
Segment #76  [00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:08,300] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 脑子里没东西
Segment #77  [00:02:08,300 --> 00:02:09,120] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 越力少
Segment #78  [00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:09,940] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 经验少
Segment #79  [00:02:09,940 --> 00:02:10,900] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 积累的也少
Segment #80  [00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:12,180] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 你嘴皮再溜
Segment #81  [00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:14,460] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 11 | Text: 你说出来的内容也会平淡无奇
Segment #82  [00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:16,500] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 9  | Text: 那针对于这类的好朋友
Segment #83  [00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:18,940] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 9  | Text: 都是教你一个很好用的办法
Segment #84  [00:02:18,940 --> 00:02:20,580] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 那就是复书
Segment #85  [00:02:20,580 --> 00:02:21,340] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 2  | Text: 复书
Segment #86  [00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:23,060] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不用看很多人说的
Segment #87  [00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:24,260] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 哎呀看到好文章
Segment #88  [00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:25,160] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 我要去背缝
Segment #89  [00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,000] | Elapsed:  88.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 我要去摘创
Segment #90  [00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,320] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 你这样太笨也太麻烦
Segment #91  [00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,580] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 你肯定坚持不下来
Segment #92  [00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:30,580] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 我只需要你养成一个习惯
Segment #93  [00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:32,580] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是你看完一本书
Segment #94  [00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,900] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者说你看完一个短视频
Segment #95  [00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:35,660] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 一个电影
Segment #96  [00:02:35,660 --> 00:02:36,700] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 合上它
Segment #97  [00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:38,280] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 你用你自己的内容
Segment #98  [00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,240] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 你用你自己的话
Segment #99  [00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,900] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 11 | Text: 把你看到的内容去复书一遍
Segment #100 [00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:43,020] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 11 | Text: 那比如说你今天看到我这些视频
Segment #101 [00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,660] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 你用你自己的语言
Segment #102 [00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:46,180] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 在评论区里去复书一下
Segment #103 [00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:48,260] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 10 | Text: 我这些视频的大体内容
Segment #104 [00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:49,200] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 看看能不能做到
Segment #105 [00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,640] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 八九五十的复书出来
Segment #106 [00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:52,460] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个训练看似在
Segment #107 [00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:53,700] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 锻炼你的总结能力
Segment #108 [00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,600] | Elapsed: 106.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 虽然你是用打字的形式
Segment #109 [00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,900] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 把你想说的话写在评论区
Segment #110 [00:02:57,900 --> 00:03:01,000] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 13 | Text: 但其实你的口才在这个复书的过程中
Segment #111 [00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,300] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 会有一个很大的提升
Segment #112 [00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:03,920] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定要养成这种
Segment #113 [00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,540] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 思维方式
Segment #114 [00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,580] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 有一句话叫做
Segment #115 [00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:09,420] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 日游所长不见其争
Segment #116 [00:03:09,420 --> 00:03:10,460] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你看那个竹笋
Segment #117 [00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:11,640] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 你盯着它看
Segment #118 [00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,120] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 你看不出来它有任何变化
Segment #119 [00:03:13,540 --> 00:03:13,900] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 1  | Text: 但是
Segment #120 [00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:15,360] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 它这个过程
Segment #121 [00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,980] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 你放它那两小时不动
Segment #122 [00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:18,340] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 你转眼再过来看它的时候
Segment #123 [00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,220] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 它已经长这么高
Segment #124 [00:03:20,380 --> 00:03:21,000] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #125 [00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,760] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 关于口才的练习方式
Segment #126 [00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:24,380] | Elapsed: 122.69s | Words: 3  | Text: 也一样
Segment #127 [00:03:24,380 --> 00:03:26,560] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 11 | Text: 其实你就按照我说的这种复书
Segment #128 [00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,960] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 12 | Text: 这种形式去融入到你的生活当中
Segment #129 [00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,200] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 9  | Text: 你不管是看一个视频也好
Segment #130 [00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,260] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 看一个电影也罢
Segment #131 [00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:33,380] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 无论用什么方式
Segment #132 [00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:34,060] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 什么素材
Segment #133 [00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:36,540] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 12 | Text: 你的内容能力就会有很大的提升
Segment #134 [00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:39,560] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 然后就是这个逻辑能力了
Segment #135 [00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,220] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 2  | Text: 逻辑
Segment #136 [00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:42,700] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 我感觉就是
Segment #137 [00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:44,500] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 但凡说上过小学
Segment #138 [00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:45,620] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 写过小学作文
Segment #139 [00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:46,360] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 你都应该知道
Segment #140 [00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,020] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 10 | Text: 什么叫做叙事文和议论文
Segment #141 [00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:50,100] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是描述一件事情最基本的结构
Segment #142 [00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:51,320] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 2  | Text: 是不是就是
Segment #143 [00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:52,060] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 2  | Text: 起因
Segment #144 [00:03:52,060 --> 00:03:53,360] | Elapsed: 138.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 经过结果
Segment #145 [00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:55,060] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 你只要遵循这个逻辑
Segment #146 [00:03:55,060 --> 00:03:56,160] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 没有人会说你说话
Segment #147 [00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:56,680] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有逻辑
Segment #148 [00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:58,320] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 逻辑这个东西
Segment #149 [00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,940] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 说白了就是结构和条理
Segment #150 [00:03:59,940 --> 00:04:01,420] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 3  | Text: 所以如果说
Segment #151 [00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:02,460] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 你经常说东西的时候
Segment #152 [00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:03,060] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 感觉哎呀
Segment #153 [00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:04,620] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 你大脑袋一片模糊
Segment #154 [00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:05,800] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 那就强迫自己
Segment #155 [00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,420] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 10 | Text: 每次都遵循这两个逻辑
Segment #156 [00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:07,820] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 2  | Text: 就好了
Segment #157 [00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,340] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 根本没有必要去看
Segment #158 [00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:10,600] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 什么关于逻辑类的书
Segment #159 [00:04:11,380 --> 00:04:12,560] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 6  | Text: 咱们聊完基本功
Segment #160 [00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,180] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 咱们再想另外一大问题
Segment #161 [00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:15,420] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是不动脑
Segment #162 [00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:16,340] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 3  | Text: 没思考
Segment #163 [00:04:16,740 --> 00:04:19,180] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 我以前很喜欢去看一些节目
Segment #164 [00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:20,160] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 3  | Text: 非常误导
Segment #165 [00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,300] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 还有一个求职的
Segment #166 [00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:22,620] | Elapsed: 158.25s | Words: 5  | Text: 叫非你莫属
Segment #167 [00:04:22,620 --> 00:04:24,600] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是每次当那个求职者
Segment #168 [00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,580] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 与老板的理念
Segment #169 [00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:26,620] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 产生分歧的时候
Segment #170 [00:04:26,620 --> 00:04:28,720] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 10 | Text: 双方就会为此展开辩论
Segment #171 [00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,280] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 对于这种东西
Segment #172 [00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:30,820] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 我感觉真的是
Segment #173 [00:04:30,820 --> 00:04:32,040] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 外行看着脑袋
Segment #174 [00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,320] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 内行看着脑袋
Segment #175 [00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,020] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 外行看着什么
Segment #176 [00:04:34,020 --> 00:04:35,280] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 看谁的气势更凶
Segment #177 [00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,620] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 谁说的更有道理
Segment #178 [00:04:36,620 --> 00:04:37,900] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 两个人来回掰扯
Segment #179 [00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:39,200] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 两个人争辩
Segment #180 [00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:39,960] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 不由得感慨
Segment #181 [00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:40,960] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 哎呀这老板行
Segment #182 [00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,340] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 这老板生意做的正大
Segment #183 [00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:42,920] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 2  | Text: 这么大
Segment #184 [00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,800] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 果然口才好
Segment #185 [00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,120] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 哎呀这求职者也不错
Segment #186 [00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:45,620] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 口才挺好
Segment #187 [00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:46,900] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 2  | Text: 我跟你说
Segment #188 [00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:47,760] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 就你这种状态
Segment #189 [00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,120] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 2  | Text: 你放心
Segment #190 [00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,360] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 你不管看什么结果
Segment #191 [00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:51,180] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 不管看什么节目
Segment #192 [00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:52,200] | Elapsed: 180.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 结果都是一样的
Segment #193 [00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,420] | Elapsed: 198.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是纯属削磨时间
Segment #194 [00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,760] | Elapsed: 198.87s | Words: 3  | Text: 问题是什么
Segment #195 [00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:56,760] | Elapsed: 198.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 问题是你压根都没有动脑
Segment #196 [00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,160] | Elapsed: 198.87s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有思考
Segment #197 [00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,620] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 7  | Text: 正确的做法是什么
Segment #198 [00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:00,780] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 3  | Text: 也不难
Segment #199 [00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:02,900] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 10 | Text: 你把它看做成一场辩论赛
Segment #200 [00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,200] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 5  | Text: 就几个步骤
Segment #201 [00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:04,780] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 1  | Text: 第一
Segment #202 [00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:05,660] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是比方说
Segment #203 [00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:06,640] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 6  | Text: 拿到辩题之后
Segment #204 [00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,860] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 7  | Text: 你先看别人怎么辩
Segment #205 [00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:08,720] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 2  | Text: 你自己
Segment #206 [00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,020] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 8  | Text: 试身处地的想一想
Segment #207 [00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:10,900] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 5  | Text: 你自己选一边
Segment #208 [00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:12,240] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 4  | Text: 如果说是你
Segment #209 [00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:13,800] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 4  | Text: 你会怎么说
Segment #210 [00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,480] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 7  | Text: 每个论点都会用
Segment #211 [00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,520] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 6  | Text: 用什么样的例子
Segment #212 [00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,300] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 5  | Text: 去作为支撑
Segment #213 [00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:18,620] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 5  | Text: 不用两边都行
Segment #214 [00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:19,820] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 8  | Text: 你只要想一边就行
Segment #215 [00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,260] | Elapsed: 198.88s | Words: 4  | Text: 时间要富裕
Segment #216 [00:05:21,260 --> 00:05:22,020] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 你再想一想
Segment #217 [00:05:22,020 --> 00:05:23,520] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 10 | Text: 你的对手会用什么样的观点
Segment #218 [00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,300] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 去回击你
Segment #219 [00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:26,120] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个练习可以非常好的
Segment #220 [00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,060] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 锻炼你的观点
Segment #221 [00:05:27,060 --> 00:05:28,160] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 罗列的能力
Segment #222 [00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,240] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 以后你对待事情
Segment #223 [00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,300] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 就有自己的看法了
Segment #224 [00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:31,820] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 第二个就是
Segment #225 [00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:34,060] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是这种辩论的时候
Segment #226 [00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:35,940] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 当场上有人与你的观点
Segment #227 [00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:36,840] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 与其对立的时候
Segment #228 [00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,260] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 你想怎么去反驳他
Segment #229 [00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:39,100] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 去挑他的字
Segment #230 [00:05:39,100 --> 00:05:40,400] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 这里边就需要你
Segment #231 [00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,880] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 9  | Text: 有一点这种鋼筋思维了
Segment #232 [00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:42,940] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 这一点很重要
Segment #233 [00:05:43,700 --> 00:05:45,140] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们很多人之所以觉得
Segment #234 [00:05:45,140 --> 00:05:46,400] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 谁都说的有道理
Segment #235 [00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:47,280] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 本质的原因
Segment #236 [00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,860] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是因为你的思考能力不行
Segment #237 [00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:49,920] | Elapsed: 216.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 前段时间
Segment #238 [00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,000] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 有的他们卖芯片的
Segment #239 [00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:51,680] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 一直在怼我
Segment #240 [00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,660] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 虽然我很烦那些
Segment #241 [00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:55,160] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 成天在别人评论区里
Segment #242 [00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,340] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 慷慨鸡羊的杠精
Segment #243 [00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:58,220] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是咱们有一说一
Segment #244 [00:05:58,220 --> 00:05:59,900] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是有一说一
Segment #245 [00:05:59,900 --> 00:06:01,900] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 把他们的固执和极端
Segment #246 [00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:03,640] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 拨开一边先不谈
Segment #247 [00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,400] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们还真的是一群
Segment #248 [00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:06,460] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 有自己的观点
Segment #249 [00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:08,340] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 并且势死捍卫的一波人
Segment #250 [00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,520] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说我要选择回应的话
Segment #251 [00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:11,840] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 我就要
Segment #252 [00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,640] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 首先我是不选择回应
Segment #253 [00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,940] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说我要选择回应的话
Segment #254 [00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:16,280] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 那我肯定得有点
Segment #255 [00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,860] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 这种鸡蛋的挑剔和能力
Segment #256 [00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:19,340] | Elapsed: 234.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 即使对比方的观点
Segment #257 [00:06:19,340 --> 00:06:20,460] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 在我看来无懈可及
Segment #258 [00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:22,760] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 12 | Text: 我也能举出两个极端的反力来
Segment #259 [00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,380] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #260 [00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:24,820] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 6  | Text: 更何况他的观点
Segment #261 [00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:26,180] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 有些时候都没逻辑性
Segment #262 [00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:27,600] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 3  | Text: 所以我也希望
Segment #263 [00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,820] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 6  | Text: 关注到我的朋友们
Segment #264 [00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:31,220] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 11 | Text: 你们也有自己独立思考的能力
Segment #265 [00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:32,920] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 9  | Text: 有些没事你都对我两句
Segment #266 [00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,880] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 时间久了你会有很多问题
Segment #267 [00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,640] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就会有自己的观点
Segment #268 [00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:38,700] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后就是第三点
Segment #269 [00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:40,580] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 我还是拿类似的这种
Segment #270 [00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:42,500] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 辩论会举例
Segment #271 [00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:44,560] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 不管你是辩防还是正防
Segment #272 [00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,920] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 无论你是一个求职者
Segment #273 [00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,140] | Elapsed: 251.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 还是一个硬聘的老板
Segment #274 [00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:49,380] | Elapsed: 266.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 当你发表完一些言论之后
Segment #275 [00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:50,580] | Elapsed: 266.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定会有你之前
Segment #276 [00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:52,280] | Elapsed: 266.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 还没有想到的东西
Segment #277 [00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:54,960] | Elapsed: 266.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 一些精妙的观点和例子
Segment #278 [00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,480] | Elapsed: 266.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个时候你就要开始深思了
Segment #279 [00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,160] | Elapsed: 266.66s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #280 [00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,660] | Elapsed: 266.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 我什么自己没想到
Segment #281 [00:06:58,660 --> 00:07:00,440] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 9  | Text: 我可以很负责任地告诉你
Segment #282 [00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,420] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个过程是最能提高
Segment #283 [00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,480] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 一个人水平的一步
Segment #284 [00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,180] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 它可以帮你整理出
Segment #285 [00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:07,080] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 9  | Text: 梳理出你思维的盲驱
Segment #286 [00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:09,380] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 8  | Text: 让你想问题变得更全面
Segment #287 [00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:10,300] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 更有心意
Segment #288 [00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:12,120] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 3  | Text: 这里需要注意
Segment #289 [00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,820] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 你需要补充的是观点
Segment #290 [00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:15,080] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 而不是例子
Segment #291 [00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,020] | Elapsed: 266.67s | Words: 7  | Text: 就像我视频开头
Segment #292 [00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:17,320] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 就像前面说的那句话一样
Segment #293 [00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,220] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 日有所长不见其增
Segment #294 [00:07:19,220 --> 00:07:21,360] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 本质上对你没有任何的帮助
Segment #295 [00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:23,680] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 9  | Text: 因为这只是一个顺片化信息
Segment #296 [00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,000] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 你就像看我的视频一样
Segment #297 [00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,860] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 没有任何差别
Segment #298 [00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:28,560] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 12 | Text: 你就算给它完完整整的背下来
Segment #299 [00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,300] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 也不会对你有什么帮助
Segment #300 [00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:31,380] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 重点是什么
Segment #301 [00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:34,040] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 9  | Text: 重点是我为什么要说这句话
Segment #302 [00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,280] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 10 | Text: 为了证明自己什么样的观点
Segment #303 [00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,820] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 这个才是我们最需要关心的东西
Segment #304 [00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:41,020] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 如果我每个视频你都能看完
Segment #305 [00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:42,020] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 用不了20个作品
Segment #306 [00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,320] | Elapsed: 282.70s | Words: 9  | Text: 你绝对是你朋友们当中
Segment #307 [00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,600] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 观点表达的
Segment #308 [00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,820] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 7  | Text: 口才表达的王者
Segment #309 [00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:48,420] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 最强王者
Segment #310 [00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,020] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 所以总结一下
Segment #311 [00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:51,880] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果说想提升你的表达力
Segment #312 [00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,220] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 你光看那些
Segment #313 [00:07:53,220 --> 00:07:54,800] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 7  | Text: 无论看谁的直播
Segment #314 [00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,420] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 谁的视频
Segment #315 [00:07:55,420 --> 00:07:56,500] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 6  | Text: 你只要不动脑
Segment #316 [00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:57,140] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 3  | Text: 不思考
Segment #317 [00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:58,780] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 6  | Text: 不去苦练基本功
Segment #318 [00:07:58,780 --> 00:07:59,820] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 3  | Text: 你在生活中
Segment #319 [00:07:59,820 --> 00:08:01,060] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 没有太大的长进
Segment #320 [00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:03,000] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 8  | Text: 希望今天的视频可以帮到你们
Segment #321 [00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,940] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 点赞关注
Segment #322 [00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:04,780] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 让我们下期再见
Segment #323 [00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,460] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个账号是刚注册的
Segment #324 [00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:08,060] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 3  | Text: 老天们
Segment #325 [00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:09,980] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 9  | Text: 那个号被关了14天作品
Segment #326 [00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,060] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #327 [00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:12,820] | Elapsed: 298.45s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你越来越好
